OL,3,GNEWSAMan in his 80s dies after house   
OL,4,Afire                                   
OL,6,FA man in his 80s has died following a  
OL,7,Fhouse fire in Omagh, County Tyrone.    
OL,9,FPolice said they were alerted to the   
OL,10,Fblaze at a property in Crevenagh Downs 
OL,11,Fat about 15:40 GMT on Thursday, with "a
OL,12,Freport of a person potentially         
OL,13,Ftrapped".                              
OL,15,F"Upon arrival officers entered the     
OL,16,Fproperty," the Police Service of       
OL,17,FNorthern Ireland (PSNI) said.          
OL,19,F"The man was then removed from the     
OL,20,Fhouse and given CPR by attending police
OL,21,Fand other emergency service personnel, 
OL,22,Fhowever tragically he did not survive."
